{
  "_comment": [
    "Menu definition for the DISPLAY device's LittleFS. Upload with:",
    "    pio run -e display -t uploadfs        (safe: display FS holds only this file)",
    "NEVER 'pio run -e nav -t uploadfs' -- that erases dive logs and calibration.",
    "",
    "Keep this in sync with loadDefaults() in src/menu/menu.cpp. If the file is",
    "missing the firmware falls back to that hardcoded menu, so any divergence",
    "shows up as a unit whose menu depends on whether the FS was ever flashed.",
    "",
    "The back item ('..', or 'Close' at the root) is appended automatically --",
    "do not list it here. Order matters: OFF stays last, behind a confirm."
  ],
